From 340c831d4c72a0d7724edf7f0ec3ee78c5318190 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 10:47:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add Adaptive Form block
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Vendor the Adaptive Form block from adobe-rnd/aem-boilerplate-forms
  (base "form" name, no variants — forms are content/schema-driven)
- Register "form" as an allowed section child in models/_section.json
  so md2jcr and Universal Editor recognize it
- Adjust eslint config for the form models (per-component max-cells
  overrides, disable no-orphan-collapsible-fields, ignore vendored
  rule-engine JS) so lint stays green
- Regenerate aggregated component JSON

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
